# Stray crash-recovery backups (should live under $HOME, never the repo)
*.era-backup

# Hand-made backups and one-off prompt scratch. Untracked files in the repo root
# are not free: era records every dirty path in each round's manifest, and they
# keep the dirty-tree gate armed. Ten of these accumulated over a month and became
# 10 of the 24 git_dirty entries in every self-review round (cleaned 2026-09-04).
*.bak
*.bak-*
*-PROMPT-*.md
*-EVIDENCE-*.md
